{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/my-Welcome_to_The_B.L.O.O.M_Initiative__1_.png?t=1747233251\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The B.L.O.O.M (Biotech Lethal Offensive Organic Munitions) Initiative</i> is a fast-paced <strong>2D top-down shoot 'em up</strong> where you pilot a drone through procedurally generated battlefields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/plant_1_.gif?t=1747233251\" /> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ship_1_.gif?t=1747233251\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/plant_1_.gif?t=1747233251\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/ship_1_.gif?t=1747233251\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/plant_1_.gif?t=1747233251\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Harvest, Build &amp; Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: <strong>gather resources, plant lethal bio-organisms, and defend your bases</strong> from relentless alien and native species on the hostile planet <strong>Shlee</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1747233251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>From Training to Total War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start in a basic training drone as you <strong>learn to build, plant, and fight</strong>, then dive into intense battles as two aggressive alien factions take an interest in your expanding operations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1747233251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade, Adapt, and Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your drone, adapt your strategies, and <strong>survive against overwhelming odds in this fusion of action and strategy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543740/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1747233251\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543740/dfd2a94b9b4d4845dd44ccdcecf1281f76580822.jpg"},{"name":"Grim Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543740/845fc5e154df2a4ce6427cc8cb4db8262ac473e5.jpg"},{"name":"Harbinger of Doom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543740/0dc4c652c48aa8edb75bd121fbc9c4b4ad6cc888.jpg"},{"name":"Extinction Event","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati